      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SMS Calendar Assistant\nTriggered by an incoming text to your Twilio number.\nReply \"tomorrow\" -> texts back tomorrow's agenda across all 3 accounts.\nReply \"week\" -> texts back the next 7 days across all 3 accounts.\nReply \"add: <event>\" -> parses it and creates a Google Calendar event on your Dynamack calendar, then confirms by text.\nAnything else -> gets a help text.",
